@startuml deployment-diagram
title University Campus Deployment Diagram: AI-Native Edge-Cloud Infrastructure

node "Campus Edge Location 1 (Academic Building)" {
    component [Building Edge Router] as Router1
    component [Edge Gateway Node (8-core ARM/x86)] as EdgeNode1 {
        artifact [Edge Detector Microservice]
        artifact [Identity Fusion Service]
    }
}

node "Campus Edge Location 2 (Dormitory & IoT Cluster)" {
    component [Dormitory Access Switch] as Switch2
    component [Edge Gateway Node 2] as EdgeNode2 {
        artifact [Edge Detector Microservice 2]
    }
}

node "Central University Cloud Control Plane" {
    database "Redis Stream Event Bus Cluster" as RedisBus
    component [Cloud Policy & Threat Reasoner] as CloudPolicy
    component [Autonomous SOAR Engine] as SOAR
    component [Metrics & Observability Dashboard] as Observability
}

Router1 --> EdgeNode1 : Network Mirror / TAP
Switch2 --> EdgeNode2 : Network Mirror / TAP

EdgeNode1 --> RedisBus : TLS Encrypted Event Stream (Port 6379)
EdgeNode2 --> RedisBus : TLS Encrypted Event Stream (Port 6379)

RedisBus --> CloudPolicy : Subscribe Event Stream
CloudPolicy --> SOAR : Trigger Mitigation Playbook
SOAR --> Router1 : API Enforcement (BGP/ACL/VLAN)
SOAR --> Switch2 : API Enforcement (802.1X Revocation)

CloudPolicy --> Observability : Push Metrics (Prometheus)
@enduml
